  "900.3.10(295)": {
   "explanation": "Lands under exception RD 295 have a 0.9 m minimum side setback and 3.6 m where the side lot line abuts a street. Setbacks along Warden Ave. and Pharmacy Ave. are measured from the street centreline and are not modelled. A prevailing Scarborough by-law applies at 1785 Victoria Park Ave.",
